==Latin==

===Etymology===
The base is derived from the Proto-Italic verb {{m|itc-pro|*deikō|*deikesi}}, more specifically the aorist, which has the base ''deiks-''. Displaced the original perfect, ''*dedikai'', which would have yielded ''*didicī''.

===Pronunciation===
